            "shortMessage": "The window's view follows the interface it shares",
            "shortMessageMarkdown": null,
            "shortMessageMarkdownLink": "<a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"The window&#39;s view follows the interface it shares\n\nThe same packs, the same borderless controls and the same reads the extension\nuses, so the two surfaces do not drift into two products. The window keeps only\nwhat is its own: the sign-in, the chrome around the page, and the springs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor &lt;cursoragent@cursor.com&gt;\" class=\"color-fg-default\" href=\"/flazouh/githubpro/commit/3f129342dd97adb96cdf2bd2e2f9e815812213dd\">The window's view follows the interface it shares</a>",
            "bodyMessageHtml": "The same packs, the same borderless controls and the same reads the extension\nuses, so the two surfaces do not drift into two products. The window keeps only\nwhat is its own: the sign-in, the chrome around the page, and the springs.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor &lt;cursoragent@cursor.com&gt;",
