          {
            "oid": "cdce3507ff52c93216a3f4b0ae829ffb2a643f5e",
            "url": "/flazouh/githubpro/commit/cdce3507ff52c93216a3f4b0ae829ffb2a643f5e",
            "authoredDate": "2026-08-01T22:23:35.000+02:00",
            "committedDate": "2026-08-01T22:23:35.000+02:00",
            "shortMessage": "The settings preview stops showing an app with borders",
            "shortMessageMarkdown": null,
            "shortMessageMarkdownLink": "<a data-pjax=\"true\" title=\"The settings preview stops showing an app with borders\n\nThese tiles are pictures of the interface, so a preview still wearing outlines is a\npreview telling a reader the app has them. Each tile becomes a fill on the figure&#39;s\ninset, and the strips inside the tree picture sit on the lighter surface the real\nones sit on.\n\nThe theme swatches keep an edge, and it is deliberate: they are painted in another\npack&#39;s canvas, which on a light appearance is close enough to the figure behind them\nthat a swatch with no edge is a swatch you cannot find. The line they draw is the one\nthat pack declares, so it is showing you the theme rather than our own chrome.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor &lt;cursoragent@cursor.com&gt;\" class=\"color-fg-default\" href=\"/flazouh/githubpro/commit/cdce3507ff52c93216a3f4b0ae829ffb2a643f5e\">The settings preview stops showing an app with borders</a>",
            "bodyMessageHtml": "These tiles are pictures of the interface, so a preview still wearing outlines is a\npreview telling a reader the app has them. Each tile becomes a fill on the figure's\ninset, and the strips inside the tree picture sit on the lighter surface the real\nones sit on.\n\nThe theme swatches keep an edge, and it is deliberate: they are painted in another\npack's canvas, which on a light appearance is close enough to the figure behind them\nthat a swatch with no edge is a swatch you cannot find. The line they draw is the one\nthat pack declares, so it is showing you the theme rather than our own chrome.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor &lt;cursoragent@cursor.com&gt;",
